The body parameter is being lost in many recent calls. Let me look at the schema for execute again carefully:

```
"execute": {
  "parameters": {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "mode": {...},
      "request": {...},
      "target": {...}
    },
    "type": "object"
  }
}
```

For request, the schema says "request": {"anyOf": [{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}},{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}

So request can be an object, string, or null. I've been passing as object. Earlier successful calls did too. Maybe it's just flakiness on certain calls.

Let me try one with a clean simple JSON write approach.
